@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:architecture;security] answers-from-fs
The adapter MUST answer the kernel only with what `dfs_mount::Fs` returns for dfs objects. It MUST
NOT send requests to the dfs server itself, except to refresh the session.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:security] session-key-secret
The session key MUST NOT appear in the command line, logs, error messages or `Debug` output.
